rule cheapest_line v1
description "Whether an order holds a line of 80 yen or less. An order comes to 250 yen or more, and a line is 100 yen at most: the cheapest line reaches the bottom only with other lines beside it, none of them cheaper"

# A line of the order
elements lines
  price : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=100JPY

min cheapest over lines of price empty 100JPY
sum total over lines of price  range >=250JPY <=500JPY

outputs
  cheap : bool

table cheap_of
policy unique
| cheapest | -> cheap |
| <=80JPY  | true     |
| >80JPY   | false    |
